Base build for 2026-27 VEX Override Season
include/ directory contains complementary files to those in src/
auto.cpp, skills.cpp along with complmentary robot/auton.h, and robot/skills.h only contain headers and need actual functions for their respective usage
globals.h and globals.cpp contains unitializaed and uninitialized global variables that are accessible in any file, just declare in header
util.cpp and util.hpp contains the helper functions that utilize global variables to work in the main file

main.cpp contains the main functions for driving.